{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56613","headline":"君臣同德赋附歌 · 无名氏","name":"君臣同德赋附歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"元良明哉！股肱良哉！盛德至矣，大业广矣！我一人兮化无穷，临万国兮道既融。\n同心同德，君圣臣忠，子子孙孙，永代克隆。\n（见同前卷四三缺名《君臣同德赋》附。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56613.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56613","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}